<span id="S4.F3.13.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison of token representations under degradations:</span>
Attention visualizations of (a) VisRAG and (b) RobustVisRAG.
(c) Clean version corresponding to (a) and (b).
t-SNE visualization of <math id="S4.F3.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z_{\text{deg}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>Z</mi><mtext>deg</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z_{\text{deg}}</annotation></semantics></math> from (d) RobustVisRAG w/o <math id="S4.F3.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{NCDM}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>NCDM</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{NCDM}}</annotation></semantics></math> &amp; <math id="S4.F3.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}_{\text{CSA}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mtext>CSA</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}_{\text{CSA}}</annotation></semantics></math> and (e) RobustVisRAG.
</span></figcaption>
